{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31155","headline":"牡丹四首 四 · 薛能","name":"牡丹四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牡丹愁爲牡丹饥，自惜多情欲瘦羸。\n浓艳冷香初盖後，好风乾雨正开时。\n吟蜂遍坐无闲蘂，醉客曾偷有折枝。\n京国别来谁占翫，此花光景属吾诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}